      "Two things to know before booking. First, the road between Num and Seduwa crosses the Arun by a Bailey bridge that collapsed in February 2026; we will tell you honestly whether it is open for your dates, and if it is not, the plan reverts to walking from Num and the trip becomes 18 days. Second, the flight to Tumlingtar is weather-dependent, and a cancellation will cost a day that this schedule does not have, so please leave at least two spare days before your onward flight."
